# syntax=docker/dockerfile:1@sha256:ecfaec9ed6d810b56388c508f4121597bfbba70d41a6dfeee4d8cad5f295fc32
# cibuildwheel 3.2.1's manylinux_2_28 image, pinned to its registry digest.
FROM quay.io/pypa/manylinux_2_28_x86_64@sha256:66eb5f6dadae4b343b4c22846adc27d2130ae753a7e59f7eb34de545422badd1

ENV PATH="/opt/python/cp313-cp313/bin:${PATH}"
# Keep newer C++ runtime symbols private rather than raising the wheel's glibc baseline.
ENV CXXFLAGS="-static-libstdc++ -static-libgcc"
RUN python -m pip install --no-cache-dir cmake==3.31.10 ninja==1.13.0
